/-
Yuanda Xu's Theorem 1 on simple zeros of the Riemann zeta function
Michael Devine <mike@circumjovial.com>

The final declaration xu_simple_zeros proves the cumulative 71.27406684%
bound in arXiv:2611.34546v1, assuming RH. We give a different proof of Xu's
statement. Our eight-detector estimate bounds the number of distinct
locations. If S locations are simple and D locations are distinct, their
total multiplicity N satisfies N >= S + 2(D - S). The last two declarations
apply this inequality to the cumulative distinct-zero estimate and recover
Xu's stated constant. The assets, changes and mathematical inputs used for
that intermediate result are credited below.
-/

